    "Each revision starts from a page reload with explicit initial white background. The menu and picker are opened by browser clicks.",
    "An End key is sent before the six Backspace keys in each revision. Three Tab keys move focus out of the input; the popup stays open and the input is captured again.",
    "fill actions replace the field through the CUA browser UI API. They are not evidence for per-character typing or mobile IME behavior.",
    "The CUA helper closure retained its initial after label when the external revision variable changed. capturedLabel preserves that raw metadata. Revision is resolved ONLY from visibleCommit read from the page and bound to the original source; no observed values are relabeled from an assumption.",
    "All 36 records share the geometry stored in common, checked against the raw CUA array before compacting it. Profiles retain distinct ARIA/error/style observations.",
    "Screenshots were inspected through CUA, not retained as image files. Error rectangles and computed colors are sampled observations, not proof of screen-reader announcement or all visual states."
